                        ### ────────────────────────────────────────────
                        ### ④ 已结案（案卷封存）
                        ###   判据：¬th_gensokyo_tarnish_mark ∧ th_gensokyo_verdict_done
                        ###     = 曾被宣判（verdict_done 常驻，effects:1186-1187）
                        ###       且案件已结（tarnish 已被 ① 清理效果摘除，
                        ###       effects:37-61 ← 调用点 effects:716 ⑦ 案件结案）
                        ###   ★ 为什么"审判庭是否已解散"不能当判据：
                        ###     ⑤ 清理（effects:1238-1241）在**宣判当场**就
                        ###     th_gensokyo_trial_cleanup_effect（解散审判庭）
                        ###     ⇒ 服刑态与已结案态的审判庭**都**已解散，该条件不可区分。
                        ###   ★ GUI 拿不到"结案日期 / 刑期"（无对应国家变量），
                        ###     故本卡只出徽记 + 封存提示，不做日期与刑期（见报告 §8）。
                        ### ────────────────────────────────────────────
                        ### ④ 已结案 —— 紧凑卡（写法同 ①，见段首取证注释）
                        vbox = {
                            layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                            spacing = 0

                            button = {
                                layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                                size = { -1 32 }
                                using = bg_scroll_card_header
                                onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Toggle( 'th_tribunal_case_closed' )]"
                                hbox = {
                                    layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                                    spacing = 5
                                    margin = { 10 0 }
                                    icon = {
                                        size = { 20 20 }
                                        texture = "gfx/interface/icons/flat_icons/laws.dds"
                                        texture_density = 2
                                    }
                                    text_single = {
                                        using = Font_Size_Small
                                        default_format = "#header_titles"
                                        raw_text = "[Localize('TH_TRIBUNAL_GROUP_CLOSED')]"
                                    }
                                    expand = {}
                                    icon = {
                                        size = { 18 18 }
                                        texture = "gfx/interface/buttons/flats/button_simple_right.dds"
                                        visible = "[Not(GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'th_tribunal_case_closed' ))]"
                                    }
                                    icon = {
                                        size = { 18 18 }
                                        texture = "gfx/interface/buttons/flats/button_simple_down.dds"
                                        visible = "[GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'th_tribunal_case_closed' )]"
                                    }
                                }
                            }

                            vbox = {
                                layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                                visible = "[GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'th_tribunal_case_closed' )]"
                                ### 隐形即不占位（语义/先例见 ① 卡注释）
                                ignoreinvisible = yes
                                margin = { 4 3 }
                                spacing = 2
                            vbox = {
                                layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                                ignoreinvisible = yes
                                datamodel = "[GetInternationalOrganization('th_gensokyo_io').GetMembers]"
                                item = {
                                    hbox = {
                                        using = bg_paper_card
                                        layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
                                        spacing = 5
                                        margin = { 4 1 }
                                        visible = "[And(Not(Country.MakeScope.GetVariable('th_gensokyo_tarnish_mark').IsSet), Country.MakeScope.GetVariable('th_gensokyo_verdict_done').IsSet)]"
                                        ### ★ 隐形时不占位（否则每行都预留空高）
                                        ignoreinvisible = yes
                                        country_flag_small = {}
                                        text_single = {
                                            using = Font_Size_Very_Small
                                            raw_text = "[Country.GetNameWithNoTooltip]"
